--[[
	ADVANCED PATHFINDER v1
	Created by Spvico

	Custom A* pathfinder (NO PathfindingService) with physics-aware obby jumping.
	Run as a LocalScript (StarterPlayerScripts) or paste into an executor.

	Button  : quick tap = ON/OFF, hold > 1s = drag mode (move it, release to drop).
	When ON : tap the world -> slope check (<= 80 deg) -> path -> walk / jump there.
	Moving the joystick or WASD cancels the current route.

	Jump model (per jump edge):
	  - takeoff point = real edge of the current part, landing point = inset point on the
	    target part (center for small parts, so 1x1 studs works)
	  - flight time solved from JumpPower/JumpHeight + gravity, reach = WalkSpeed * time
	  - run-up never stops: Move() stays active, jump is fired while still running
	  - in the air, throttle is recomputed EVERY FRAME from (distance left / time left)
	    so you touch down exactly on the landing point without braking before the jump
]]

